{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09880","headline":"故河南尹岐国公赠工部尚书苏公挽歌二首 一 · 岑参","name":"故河南尹岐国公赠工部尚书苏公挽歌二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河尹恩荣旧，尚书宠赠新。\n一门传画戟，几世驾朱轮。\n夜色何时晓，泉台不复春。\n唯余朝服在，金印已生尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09880.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09880","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}